<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{ site.name }} | Houseplants, hand-potted</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
{% render 'header', site: site %}
<main>
  {% section 'hero', headline: "Plants for every windowsill", subhead: "Hand-potted houseplants, shipped with care.", photo: "hero", button: "Shop plants", button_link: "/products" %}

  <section class="band">
    <h2>Featured plants</h2>
    <p data-editable="text">Our four most-loved plants this month, all in stock and ready to ship.</p>
    <ul class="grid">
      {% for product in collections.featured.products limit: 4 %}
        <li>{% render 'product-card', product: product %}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p><a class="button secondary" href="/products">See every plant</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--tint">
    <h2>New to plants?</h2>
    <p>Start with a pothos or a snake plant. Both forgive a missed watering, and both clean the air a little.</p>
  </section>
</main>
{% render 'footer', site: site %}
</body>
</html>
